END 块。不需要背 API，但要能解释 awk '{print $1}' access.log</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>面试</category><category>awk</category><category>面试</category></item><item><title>Linux效率-终端快捷命令</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-09-linux%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</link><pubDate>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 13:58:08 +0800</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 09 Apr 2024 13:58:08 +0800</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2024-04-09-linux%E6%95%88%E7%8E%87-%E7%BB%88%E7%AB%AF%E5%BF%AB%E6%8D%B7%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 大多数快捷键来自 Readline Bash、Python REPL、MySQL CLI 等交互程序常复用这套编辑能力 Ctrl+s 不是暂停程序，而是终端流控 它发送 XOFF 暂</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-4: 安装包管理</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2023-11-02-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-4_%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%8C%85%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Thu, 02 Nov 2023 13:58:08 +0800</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 02 Nov 2023 13:58:08 +0800</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2023-11-02-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-4_%E5%AE%89%E8%A3%85%E5%8C%85%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 RPM / DEB 是包格式，也是底层包管理体系 负责安装、卸载、查询本地包，但依赖处理能力有限 YUM / DNF / APT 是仓库管理器 负责从远程仓库解析依赖、下</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category><category>包管理</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>sudo echo 重定向报权限拒绝的原因与处理</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-4-sudo%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83echo%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF/</link><pubDate>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 22:05:32 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Mon, 28 Aug 2023 22:05:32 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/kubernetes/2023-08-28-k8s%E9%83%A8%E7%BD%B2%E5%AE%9E%E5%BD%95-4-sudo%E6%8F%90%E6%9D%83echo%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E9%87%8D%E5%AE%9A%E5%90%91%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E7%AC%A6%E4%BC%9A%E6%8A%A5%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E9%94%99%E8%AF%AF/</guid><description>重要 sudo echo 'xxx' &amp;gt;&amp;gt; /etc/hosts 会报权限拒绝。原因：sudo 只作用于 echo，&amp;gt;&amp;gt; 重定向由当前 shell 以普通用户权限打开文件。 1.简介 Kubelet 集群部署时需要修</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Sudo</category><category>Bash</category><category>故障排查</category><category>Linux</category><category>Bash</category><category>k8s部署实录</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-3-特殊设备文件[loop,null,zero,full,random,tcp..]</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-27-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-3-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6loopnullzerofullrandomtcp../</link><pubDate>Thu, 27 Oct 2022 01:46:34 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 27 Oct 2022 01:46:34 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-27-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-3-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E8%AE%BE%E5%A4%87%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6loopnullzerofullrandomtcp../</guid><description>核心结论 说明 /dev/null 是黑洞，/dev/zero 是零流 前者读到 EOF，后者读出无限 \0 /dev/full 专门用于模拟磁盘写满 写入永远返回 ENOSPC 现代 Linux 中 /dev/random 和 /dev/urandom 差异已经很小 随</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category><category>特殊/dev</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-2-特殊权限[s·t]</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-26-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-2-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90st/</link><pubDate>Wed, 26 Oct 2022 06:38:19 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 26 Oct 2022 06:38:19 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-26-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-2-%E7%89%B9%E6%AE%8A%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90st/</guid><description>核心结论 细节 SUID 改变进程有效用户 普通用户执行带 SUID 的二进制程序时，进程临时获得该程序属主权限，典型例子是 /usr/bin/passwd SGID 对文件和目录含义不同 用在可执行文件上</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category><category>特殊权限</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>Linux查漏补缺-1-链接</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-25-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-1-%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5/</link><pubDate>Tue, 25 Oct 2022 03:45:44 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Tue, 25 Oct 2022 03:45:44 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-10-25-linux%E6%9F%A5%E6%BC%8F%E8%A1%A5%E7%BC%BA-1-%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5/</guid><description>核心结论 细节 目录软链接删除区分带 / 与不带 / rm &amp;lt;软链接&amp;gt;/ 触发目标目录的删除逻辑，rm &amp;lt;软链接&amp;gt; 只删除软链接文件本身 硬</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux</category><category>Linux操作系统-查漏补缺</category></item><item><title>bash脚本set命令说明</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-03-30-bash%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%ACset%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Mar 2022 07:40:03 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Wed, 30 Mar 2022 07:40:03 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2022-03-30-bash%E8%84%9A%E6%9C%ACset%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E8%AF%B4%E6%98%8E/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 set -e 不是万能错误处理 它有很多例外场景，不能替代显式判断 set -u 处理的是未定义变量，不是空变量 变量已定义但值为空不会报错 管道必须配合 set</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>shell基础-Here Document与EOF用法</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2021-01-14-shell%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B9%8Beof%E7%9A%84%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 Jan 2021 07:25:14 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><atom:modified>Thu, 14 Jan 2021 07:25:14 +0000</atom:modified><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/bash/2021-01-14-shell%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E4%B9%8Beof%E7%9A%84%E7%94%A8%E6%B3%95/</guid><description>核心结论 说明 EOF 不是固定关键字 它只是 here document 的结束标记，可以换成任意字符串 &amp;lt;&amp;lt;EOF 会把多行文本作为标准输入 常与 cat、ssh、mysql、tee 配合使用</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category></item><item><title>Linux面试-137面试题</title><link>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-09-linux%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95-137%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author>hex-py@gmail.com (Hex)</author><guid>https://hex-go.github.io/posts/interview/2024-04-09-linux%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95-137%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98/</guid><description>汇总的Linux面试题，仅用于个人备忘 1、如何看当前Linux系统有几颗物理CPU和每颗CPU的核数？ 查看物理cup： 1 cat /proc/cpuinfo|grep -c ‘physic</description><dc:creator>Hex</dc:creator><category>Bash</category><category>Linux</category><category>面试</category><category>面试</category></item></channel></rss>